Hi Greg



If you=92d like to rebudget $5k plus fringe into travel, then your new trav=
el budget would be $5,790.



Regarding the 2-month summer salary rule, NSF is the only funder that has t=
his restriction.  Riccardo could take 6 weeks from NEH and 6 weeks from Sch=
midt if he wanted to.



Please let me know if you have any other questions.

Thanks!

Beth



From: Crane, Gregory <Gregory.Crane@tufts.edu>
Sent: Friday, March 20, 2026 11:19 AM
To: Gelzinis, Elizabeth <Elizabeth.Gelzinis@tufts.edu>
Cc: Strobino, Riccardo <Riccardo.Strobino@tufts.edu>
Subject: Re: federal and non-federal summer salary



Hi Beth,



Second question: If Riccardo transferred $5K from his summer salary to trav=
el, wouldn't that free up something like $6K in travel? I.e., to pay Riccar=
do $5K we have to pay $5K + summer benefits.



Can you tell us if that is the case?



Sorry for all the questions =97 and thank you as always!

________________________________

