Cc: Strobino, Riccardo <Riccardo.Strobino@tufts.edu<mailto:Riccardo.Strobin=
o@tufts.edu>>
Subject: federal and non-federal summer salary



Hi Beth,



My recollection is that NSF has a cap of 2 months summer salary and I thoug=
ht that might be the limit for all federal summer salary (e.g., you could g=
et 1 month from NSF and 1 month from NEH).



In the past, my recollection is that non-federal funding could go beyond th=
at, i.e., Mellon money could pay for part of all of a third month. Schmid S=
ciences would fit into this category.



The point is to verify that there is no reason (other than burnout) that Ri=
ccardo could not take the full 6 weeks of NEH and 6 weeks of Schmidt Scienc=
es funding.



Best,

Greg

